+# Build a widget
+> Describe a widget; get a finished Widget Blueprint you can keep editing.
+Arguments: description - what to build
+Build this in the open Unreal project with the NameTBD tools: {{description}}
+
+Work in few calls: create_widget_blueprint (fixed size if it's a card or panel), the whole tree in one add_widgets call using roles and theme tokens, then materials / particles / animate_widget as needed. Compile and save at the end, then say in two sentences what you made.
